# Component split

- Pages thin: `app/(dashboard)/{module}/page.tsx` orchestrates hooks + organisms
- Dynamic routes: `app/(dashboard)/{module}/[id]/page.tsx` (detail), `.../[id]/edit/page.tsx`
- No `apiFetch` in presentational components
- Reuse `DataListPage` shell before custom table layout
